A Freelancer creates a profile to showcase skills and experience to potential clients.
A Freelancer submits a proposal for a new project to secure work.
A Client posts a project description to find a suitable freelancer.
A Client reviews submitted proposals to select the best candidate for the project.
A Freelancer communicates with the client to clarify requirements before starting work.
A Freelancer delivers the completed work to meet the project deadline.
A Client provides feedback on the delivered work to indicate satisfaction or request revisions.
A Platform Manager verifies new project postings to ensure they meet platform guidelines.
A Platform Manager monitors payments to confirm freelancers are compensated correctly.
A Platform Manager handles reported disputes to resolve conflicts between freelancers and clients.